<code>assert \result.length == this.size();</code>

It seems there was a slight misunderstanding in the comment. The comment states "The returned array length is one greater than the collection size," but the actual behavior of the method is to return an array with a length equal to the collection size. Therefore, the correct assert statement should reflect that the length of the returned array is equal to the size of the collection.
